am|strong=\"H3068\"the|strong=\"H3068\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\"’s.’  \nAnother|strong=\"H2088\"will|strong=\"H3068\"be|strong=\"H3027\"called|strong=\"H7121\"by|strong=\"H3027\"the|strong=\"H3068\"name|strong=\"H8034\"of|strong=\"H3068\"Jacob|strong=\"H3290\";  \nand|strong=\"H3478\"another|strong=\"H2088\"will|strong=\"H3068\"write|strong=\"H3789\"with|strong=\"H3068\"his|strong=\"H3068\"hand|strong=\"H3027\"‘to|strong=\"H3478\"the|strong=\"H3068\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\",’  \nand|strong=\"H3478\"honor|strong=\"H3655\"the|strong=\"H3068\"name|strong=\"H8034\"of|strong=\"H3068\"Israel|strong=\"H3478\".”   \n"},{"number":6,"text":"This|strong=\"H3541\"is|strong=\"H3068\"what|strong=\"H3541\"the|strong=\"H3541\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\", the|strong=\"H3541\"King|strong=\"H4428\"of|strong=\"H4428\"Israel|strong=\"H3478\",  \nand|strong=\"H3478\"his|strong=\"H3068\"Redeemer|strong=\"H1350\", the|strong=\"H3541\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\"of|strong=\"H4428\"Armies|strong=\"H6635\", says|strong=\"H3541\":  \n“I|strong=\"H3541\"am|strong=\"H3068\"the|strong=\"H3541\"first|strong=\"H7223\", and|strong=\"H3478\"I|strong=\"H3541\"am|strong=\"H3068\"the|strong=\"H3541\"last;  \nand|strong=\"H3478\"besides|strong=\"H1107\"me|strong=\"H1107\"there|strong=\"H3541\"is|strong=\"H3068\"no|strong=\"H3478\"God|strong=\"H3068\".   \n"},{"number":7,"text":"Who|strong=\"H4310\"is|strong=\"H4310\"like|strong=\"H3644\"me|strong=\"H5046\"?  \nWho|strong=\"H4310\"will|strong=\"H4310\"call|strong=\"H7121\",  \nand|strong=\"H5971\"will|strong=\"H4310\"declare|strong=\"H5046\"it|strong=\"H7760\",  \nand|strong=\"H5971\"set|strong=\"H7760\"it|strong=\"H7760\"in|strong=\"H7121\"order|strong=\"H6186\"for|strong=\"H7121\"me|strong=\"H5046\",  \nsince I|strong=\"H7760\"established|strong=\"H7760\"the|strong=\"H7760\"ancient|strong=\"H5769\"people|strong=\"H5971\"?  \nLet|strong=\"H7760\"them|strong=\"H7760\"declare|strong=\"H5046\"the|strong=\"H7760\"things|strong=\"H3644\"that|strong=\"H5971\"are|strong=\"H5971\"coming,  \nand|strong=\"H5971\"that|strong=\"H5971\"will|strong=\"H4310\"happen.   \n"},{"number":8,"text":"Don’t fear|strong=\"H6342\",  \nneither|strong=\"H3808\"be|strong=\"H3426\"afraid|strong=\"H6342\".  \nHaven’t I|strong=\"H3045\"declared|strong=\"H5046\"it|strong=\"H3045\"to|strong=\"H8085\"you|strong=\"H3045\"long|strong=\"H8085\"ago,  \nand|strong=\"H8085\"shown|strong=\"H5046\"it|strong=\"H3045\"?  \nYou|strong=\"H3045\"are|strong=\"H3426\"my|strong=\"H8085\"witnesses|strong=\"H5707\".  \nIs|strong=\"H3426\"there|strong=\"H3426\"a|strong=\"H3068\"God|strong=\"H6697\"besides|strong=\"H1107\"me|strong=\"H5046\"?  \nIndeed|strong=\"H8085\", there|strong=\"H3426\"is|strong=\"H3426\"not|strong=\"H3808\".  \nI|strong=\"H3045\"don’t know|strong=\"H3045\"any|strong=\"H3426\"other|strong=\"H1107\"Rock|strong=\"H6697\".”   \n"},{"number":9,"text":"Everyone|strong=\"H3605\"who|strong=\"H3605\"makes|strong=\"H7200\"a|strong=\"H3068\"carved|strong=\"H6459\"image|strong=\"H6459\"is|strong=\"H3605\"vain|strong=\"H8414\".  \nThe|strong=\"H3605\"things|strong=\"H3605\"that|strong=\"H3045\"they|strong=\"H1992\"delight|strong=\"H2530\"in|strong=\"H7200\"will|strong=\"H4616\"not|strong=\"H3045\"profit|strong=\"H3276\".  \nTheir|strong=\"H3605\"own witnesses|strong=\"H5707\"don’t see|strong=\"H7200\", nor|strong=\"H1077\"know|strong=\"H3045\", that|strong=\"H3045\"they|strong=\"H1992\"may|strong=\"H1992\"be|strong=\"H1077\"disappointed.   \n"},{"number":10,"text":"Who|strong=\"H4310\"has|strong=\"H4310\"fashioned|strong=\"H3335\"a|strong=\"H3068\"god|strong=\"H4310\",  \nor|strong=\"H1115\"molds an|strong=\"H4310\"image|strong=\"H6459\"that|strong=\"H4310\"is|strong=\"H4310\"profitable|strong=\"H3276\"for|strong=\"H3276\"nothing|strong=\"H1115\"?   \n"},{"number":11,"text":"Behold|strong=\"H2005\", all|strong=\"H3605\"his|strong=\"H3605\"fellows|strong=\"H2270\"will|strong=\"H3162\"be|strong=\"H3162\"disappointed;  \nand|strong=\"H5975\"the|strong=\"H3605\"workmen|strong=\"H2796\"are|strong=\"H1992\"mere|strong=\"H3605\"men|strong=\"H3605\".  \nLet them|strong=\"H1992\"all|strong=\"H3605\"be|strong=\"H3162\"gathered|strong=\"H6908\"together|strong=\"H3162\".  \nLet them|strong=\"H1992\"stand|strong=\"H5975\"up|strong=\"H5975\".  \nThey|strong=\"H1992\"will|strong=\"H3162\"fear|strong=\"H6342\".  \nThey|strong=\"H1992\"will|strong=\"H3162\"be|strong=\"H3162\"put to|strong=\"H5975\"shame together|strong=\"H3162\".   \n"},{"number":12,"text":"The|strong=\"H1571\"blacksmith|strong=\"H2796\"takes an|strong=\"H1571\"ax,  \nworks|strong=\"H6466\"in|strong=\"H3808\"the|strong=\"H1571\"coals|strong=\"H6352\",  \nfashions|strong=\"H3335\"it|strong=\"H3808\"with|strong=\"H4325\"hammers|strong=\"H4717\",  \nand|strong=\"H4325\"works|strong=\"H6466\"it|strong=\"H3808\"with|strong=\"H4325\"his|strong=\"H3808\"strong|strong=\"H3581\"arm|strong=\"H2220\".  \nHe|strong=\"H3808\"is|strong=\"H1571\"hungry|strong=\"H7456\",  \nand|strong=\"H4325\"his|strong=\"H3808\"strength|strong=\"H3581\"fails;  \nhe|strong=\"H3808\"drinks|strong=\"H8354\"no|strong=\"H3808\"water|strong=\"H4325\",  \nand|strong=\"H4325\"is|strong=\"H1571\"faint|strong=\"H3286\".   \n"},{"number":13,"text":"The|strong=\"H6213\"carpenter|strong=\"H2796\"stretches|strong=\"H5186\"out|strong=\"H5186\"a|strong=\"H3068\"line|strong=\"H6957\".  \nHe|strong=\"H6213\"marks it|strong=\"H6213\"out|strong=\"H5186\"with|strong=\"H1004\"a|strong=\"H3068\"pencil.  \nHe|strong=\"H6213\"shapes|strong=\"H2796\"it|strong=\"H6213\"with|strong=\"H1004\"planes|strong=\"H4741\".  \nHe|strong=\"H6213\"marks it|strong=\"H6213\"out|strong=\"H5186\"with|strong=\"H1004\"compasses,  \nand|strong=\"H1004\"shapes|strong=\"H2796\"it|strong=\"H6213\"like|strong=\"H1004\"the|strong=\"H6213\"figure|strong=\"H8403\"of|strong=\"H1004\"a|strong=\"H3068\"man,  \nwith|strong=\"H1004\"the|strong=\"H6213\"beauty|strong=\"H8597\"of|strong=\"H1004\"a|strong=\"H3068\"man,  \nto|strong=\"H6213\"reside|strong=\"H3427\"in|strong=\"H3427\"a|strong=\"H3068\"house|strong=\"H1004\".   \n"},{"number":14,"text":"He|strong=\"H3947\"cuts|strong=\"H3772\"down|strong=\"H3772\"cedars for|strong=\"H6086\"himself|strong=\"H1431\",  \nand|strong=\"H6086\"takes|strong=\"H3947\"the|strong=\"H3947\"cypress|strong=\"H8645\"and|strong=\"H6086\"the|strong=\"H3947\"oak,  \nand|strong=\"H6086\"strengthens for|strong=\"H6086\"himself|strong=\"H1431\"one among the|strong=\"H3947\"trees|strong=\"H6086\"of|strong=\"H6086\"the|strong=\"H3947\"forest|strong=\"H3293\".  \nHe|strong=\"H3947\"plants|strong=\"H5193\"a|strong=\"H3068\"cypress|strong=\"H8645\"tree|strong=\"H6086\",  \nand|strong=\"H6086\"the|strong=\"H3947\"rain|strong=\"H1653\"nourishes it|strong=\"H3947\".   \n"},{"number":15,"text":"Then|strong=\"H1961\"it|strong=\"H6213\"will|strong=\"H1961\"be|strong=\"H1961\"for|strong=\"H6213\"a|strong=\"H3068\"man to|strong=\"H1961\"burn|strong=\"H1197\";  \nand|strong=\"H3899\"he|strong=\"H6213\"takes|strong=\"H3947\"some|strong=\"H1992\"of|strong=\"H3899\"it|strong=\"H6213\"and|strong=\"H3899\"warms|strong=\"H2552\"himself|strong=\"H7812\".  \nYes, he|strong=\"H6213\"burns|strong=\"H1197\"it|strong=\"H6213\"and|strong=\"H3899\"bakes bread|strong=\"H3899\".  \nYes, he|strong=\"H6213\"makes|strong=\"H6213\"a|strong=\"H3068\"god and|strong=\"H3899\"worships|strong=\"H7812\"it|strong=\"H6213\";  \nhe|strong=\"H6213\"makes|strong=\"H6213\"it|strong=\"H6213\"a|strong=\"H3068\"carved|strong=\"H6213\"image|strong=\"H6459\", and|strong=\"H3899\"falls|strong=\"H5456\"down|strong=\"H7812\"to|strong=\"H1961\"it|strong=\"H6213\".   \n"},{"number":16,"text":"He|strong=\"H5921\"burns|strong=\"H8313\"part|strong=\"H2677\"of|strong=\"H5921\"it|strong=\"H5921\"in|strong=\"H5921\"the|strong=\"H5921\"fire.  \nWith|strong=\"H8313\"part|strong=\"H2677\"of|strong=\"H5921\"it|strong=\"H5921\", he|strong=\"H5921\"eats meat|strong=\"H1320\".  \nHe|strong=\"H5921\"roasts|strong=\"H6740\"a|strong=\"H3068\"roast|strong=\"H6748\"and|strong=\"H7200\"is|strong=\"H1320\"satisfied|strong=\"H7646\".  \nYes|strong=\"H7200\", he|strong=\"H5921\"warms|strong=\"H2552\"himself  \nand|strong=\"H7200\"says, “Aha|strong=\"H1889\"! I|strong=\"H5921\"am warm|strong=\"H2552\". I|strong=\"H5921\"have|strong=\"H7646\"seen|strong=\"H7200\"the|strong=\"H5921\"fire.”   \n"},{"number":17,"text":"The|strong=\"H3588\"rest|strong=\"H7611\"of|strong=\"H7611\"it|strong=\"H3588\"he|strong=\"H3588\"makes|strong=\"H6213\"into|strong=\"H6213\"a|strong=\"H3068\"god,  \neven|strong=\"H3588\"his|strong=\"H6213\"engraved image|strong=\"H6459\".  \nHe|strong=\"H3588\"bows|strong=\"H7812\"down|strong=\"H7812\"to|strong=\"H6213\"it|strong=\"H3588\"and|strong=\"H6213\"worships|strong=\"H7812\",  \nand|strong=\"H6213\"prays|strong=\"H6419\"to|strong=\"H6213\"it|strong=\"H3588\", and|strong=\"H6213\"says, “Deliver|strong=\"H5337\"me|strong=\"H6213\", for|strong=\"H3588\"you|strong=\"H3588\"are|strong=\"H6213\"my|strong=\"H5337\"god!”   \n"},{"number":18,"text":"They|strong=\"H3588\"don’t know|strong=\"H3045\", neither|strong=\"H3808\"do|strong=\"H5869\"they|strong=\"H3588\"consider|strong=\"H7200\",  \nfor|strong=\"H3588\"he|strong=\"H3588\"has|strong=\"H3820\"shut|strong=\"H2902\"their|strong=\"H7200\"eyes|strong=\"H5869\", that|strong=\"H3588\"they|strong=\"H3588\"can|strong=\"H7200\"’t see|strong=\"H7200\",  \nand|strong=\"H5869\"their|strong=\"H7200\"hearts|strong=\"H3820\", that|strong=\"H3588\"they|strong=\"H3588\"can|strong=\"H7200\"’t understand|strong=\"H3045\".   \n"},{"number":19,"text":"No|strong=\"H3808\"one|strong=\"H3808\"thinks,  \nneither|strong=\"H3808\"is|strong=\"H3820\"there|strong=\"H7725\"knowledge|strong=\"H1847\"nor|strong=\"H3808\"understanding|strong=\"H8394\"to|strong=\"H7725\"say|strong=\"H7725\",  \n“I|strong=\"H5921\"have|strong=\"H3808\"burned|strong=\"H8313\"part|strong=\"H2677\"of|strong=\"H6086\"it|strong=\"H5921\"in|strong=\"H5921\"the|strong=\"H5921\"fire|strong=\"H1513\".  \nYes, I|strong=\"H5921\"have|strong=\"H3808\"also|strong=\"H6213\"baked bread|strong=\"H3899\"on|strong=\"H5921\"its|strong=\"H5921\"coals|strong=\"H1513\".  \nI|strong=\"H5921\"have|strong=\"H3808\"roasted|strong=\"H6740\"meat|strong=\"H1320\"and|strong=\"H7725\"eaten it|strong=\"H5921\".  \nShall|strong=\"H3820\"I|strong=\"H5921\"make|strong=\"H6213\"the|strong=\"H5921\"rest|strong=\"H3499\"of|strong=\"H6086\"it|strong=\"H5921\"into|strong=\"H7725\"an|strong=\"H6213\"abomination|strong=\"H8441\"?  \nShall|strong=\"H3820\"I|strong=\"H5921\"bow|strong=\"H5456\"down|strong=\"H5456\"to|strong=\"H7725\"a|strong=\"H3068\"tree|strong=\"H6086\"trunk?”   \n"},{"number":20,"text":"He|strong=\"H3808\"feeds|strong=\"H7462\"on|strong=\"H7462\"ashes.  \nA|strong=\"H3068\"deceived|strong=\"H2048\"heart|strong=\"H3820\"has|strong=\"H3820\"turned|strong=\"H5186\"him|strong=\"H5186\"aside|strong=\"H5186\";  \nand|strong=\"H3820\"he|strong=\"H3808\"can|strong=\"H3225\"’t deliver|strong=\"H5337\"his|strong=\"H5186\"soul|strong=\"H5315\",  \nnor|strong=\"H3808\"say, “Isn’t there a|strong=\"H3068\"lie|strong=\"H8267\"in|strong=\"H5315\"my|strong=\"H5337\"right|strong=\"H3225\"hand|strong=\"H3225\"?”   \n"},{"number":21,"text":"Remember|strong=\"H2142\"these|strong=\"H2142\"things|strong=\"H3808\", Jacob|strong=\"H3290\"and|strong=\"H3478\"Israel|strong=\"H3478\",  \nfor|strong=\"H3588\"you|strong=\"H3588\"are|strong=\"H3478\"my|strong=\"H2142\"servant|strong=\"H5650\".  \nI|strong=\"H3588\"have|strong=\"H5650\"formed|strong=\"H3335\"you|strong=\"H3588\".  \nYou|strong=\"H3588\"are|strong=\"H3478\"my|strong=\"H2142\"servant|strong=\"H5650\".  \nIsrael|strong=\"H3478\", you|strong=\"H3588\"will|strong=\"H3478\"not|strong=\"H3808\"be|strong=\"H3808\"forgotten|strong=\"H5382\"by|strong=\"H3478\"me|strong=\"H5650\".   \n"},{"number":22,"text":"I|strong=\"H3588\"have|strong=\"H2403\"blotted|strong=\"H4229\"out|strong=\"H4229\", as|strong=\"H3588\"a|strong=\"H3068\"thick|strong=\"H5645\"cloud|strong=\"H6051\", your|strong=\"H7725\"transgressions|strong=\"H6588\",  \nand|strong=\"H7725\", as|strong=\"H3588\"a|strong=\"H3068\"cloud|strong=\"H6051\", your|strong=\"H7725\"sins|strong=\"H2403\".  \nReturn|strong=\"H7725\"to|strong=\"H7725\"me|strong=\"H7725\", for|strong=\"H3588\"I|strong=\"H3588\"have|strong=\"H2403\"redeemed|strong=\"H1350\"you|strong=\"H3588\".   \n"},{"number":23,"text":"Sing|strong=\"H7442\", you|strong=\"H3588\"heavens|strong=\"H8064\", for|strong=\"H3588\"the|strong=\"H3605\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\"has|strong=\"H3068\"done|strong=\"H6213\"it|strong=\"H3588\"!  \nShout|strong=\"H7321\", you|strong=\"H3588\"lower|strong=\"H8482\"parts|strong=\"H8482\"of|strong=\"H3068\"the|strong=\"H3605\"earth|strong=\"H8064\"!  \nBreak|strong=\"H6476\"out|strong=\"H6213\"into|strong=\"H6476\"singing|strong=\"H7440\", you|strong=\"H3588\"mountains|strong=\"H2022\", O|strong=\"H3068\"forest|strong=\"H3293\", all|strong=\"H3605\"of|strong=\"H3068\"your|strong=\"H3068\"trees|strong=\"H6086\",  \nfor|strong=\"H3588\"the|strong=\"H3605\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\"has|strong=\"H3068\"redeemed|strong=\"H1350\"Jacob|strong=\"H3290\",  \nand|strong=\"H3478\"will|strong=\"H3068\"glorify|strong=\"H6286\"himself|strong=\"H6213\"in|strong=\"H3478\"Israel|strong=\"H3478\".   \n"},{"number":24,"text":"The|strong=\"H3605\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\", your|strong=\"H3068\"Redeemer|strong=\"H1350\",  \nand|strong=\"H3068\"he|strong=\"H6213\"who|strong=\"H3605\"formed|strong=\"H3335\"you|strong=\"H3605\"from|strong=\"H3068\"the|strong=\"H3605\"womb says|strong=\"H3541\":  \n“I|strong=\"H3541\"am|strong=\"H3068\"the|strong=\"H3605\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\", who|strong=\"H3605\"makes|strong=\"H6213\"all|strong=\"H3605\"things|strong=\"H3605\";  \nwho|strong=\"H3605\"alone|strong=\"H6213\"stretches|strong=\"H5186\"out|strong=\"H5186\"the|strong=\"H3605\"heavens|strong=\"H8064\";  \nwho|strong=\"H3605\"spreads out|strong=\"H5186\"the|strong=\"H3605\"earth|strong=\"H8064\"by|strong=\"H3068\"myself;   \n"},{"number":25,"text":"who|